{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0084","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":7,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":112,"expected_output":"screening-0084.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1849","source_sha256":"775b74fa737ef2a0f2bdf8691feb65d49209ddea09c6245ec2894f692a5e4c0a","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"تعداد اعداد سه‌رقمی که با ارقام ۲، ۳، ۵ می‌توان ساخت را نوشته و یک عدد را به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم. با چه احتمالی این عدد فقط از ۲ رقم متمایز ساخته شده است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1849","aspect_ratio":0.0442}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5321}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. برای به دست آوردن $n(A)$ به دو روش می‌توان عمل کرد.\nروش اول: ابتدا یک رقم را انتخاب کرده و از آن دو بار استفاده می‌کنیم و سپس از دو رقم باقی‌مانده یک رقم انتخاب می‌کنیم که در عدد ما یک بار استفاده می‌شود.\n$n(A) = \\binom{3}{1} \\binom{2}{1} \\frac{3!}{2!} = 18$\nروش دوم: اعدادی که فقط از یک رقم یا از سه رقم ساخته شده‌اند را از کل اعداد کم می‌کنیم.\n$n(A) = 3^3 - 3 - 3! = 27 - 3 - 6 = 18$\nخواهیم داشت:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{18}{3^3} = \\frac{18}{27} = \\frac{2}{3}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"d5dad37a18ed088f3752ca15831ade2547be3de07b2c4529fe559fdadbcdcbde","bytes":2418},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"d35b0c3430d25fb69d6515868bc6e9b43d2662d7b36eb2d168c7f88f1a2f8a1f","bytes":1220},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"444b8bd285a38bea9f2d0a35c2419413b7ad0112254ebb48f0f648d16129b987","bytes":1528},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ee40d8332e0aad6de5b7c5e5b09346e5fd4c38cdf2081444680bd6b1a5402e76","bytes":1632},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1849/stem_1.webp","sha256":"799eb7c205402e010b520188da086b2abe4740c7c80fff9c9ac28ad5da1f3f52","bytes":14246}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1849,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1850","source_sha256":"6638b403b1ada08446bcf45890d2d9e4551021b5682a88febbad99b465c8bb96","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"آهو، غزال و پروانه به همراه ۵ دوست خود کنار یکدیگر نشسته‌اند. با کدام احتمال حداقل دو نفر از این سه نفر کنار یکدیگر هستند؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1850","aspect_ratio":0.0329}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{14}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{9}{14}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{11}{14}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. از روش متمم استفاده می‌کنیم. اگر پنج دوست این سه نفر در جایگاه‌های دایره‌ای‌شکل قرار بگیرند، برای این سه نفر ۶ جایگاه وجود دارد تا هیچ‌یک از آن‌ها کنار هم قرار نگیرند.\\nبنابراین:\\n$n(A') = \\binom{6}{3} 3! 5!$\\nدر نتیجه:\\n$P(A) = 1 - P(A') = 1 - \\frac{\\binom{6}{3} 3! 5!}{8!} = 1 - \\frac{20 \\times 3!}{8 \\times 7 \\times 6} = 1 - \\frac{5}{14} = \\frac{9}{14}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"0ed4c45c5f007c7a7770ef48bfe2cfbd41d94930ebebf917a56f6c56b73db830","bytes":1392},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"7fa1f39b1ce3c87b24cf971a217545b8c7999c0e8593184ed6566705e8b8d843","bytes":974},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"488316e315ce7b055db6a12a4e74150a373b2dade02fa042d3311866663b00f2","bytes":798},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1850/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"f67d38453